    You have 5 HP. A touching enemy takes
    1 HP, then you''re safe for 1 second (Safe Time on the player''s Health).

    Beat
    every enemy to win (the Console says You win!). For a sword instead: on the Player,
    uncheck Aim Shooter and check Aim Melee.'
